# Owner Lead Workflow

MongoDB is the system of record. The server writes Mongo first, then posts or syncs side effects. Owner invariants live in the Service files below — this rule is the path outline.

## Path outline

1. **Website → Form Lead** — `POST /api/v1/form-leads`. Create, duplicates, CRM Posting, Sheet Sync: [`form-lead.md`](../../docs/knowledge/services/form-lead.md). Owner Manual tab (`/manual`) uses this same create route; owner/admin actor headers assign [Ingestion Origin](../../../CONTEXT.md) Vantage Admin. On the authorized test path, a [WordPress Form Submission Receipt](../../../CONTEXT.md) is captured before Lead persist. Confirmation SMS: [`lead-messaging.md`](../../docs/knowledge/services/lead-messaging.md). Software/payload notes: [`form-lead-granot-crm.mdc`](form-lead-granot-crm.mdc).
2. **Extension / owner updates** — `PATCH /api/v1/form-leads/:id` and call-lead PATCH; scored search + browse are separate read paths ([`form-lead-search.md`](../../docs/knowledge/services/form-lead-search.md), [`call-lead-search.md`](../../docs/knowledge/services/call-lead-search.md), [`lead-browse.md`](../../docs/knowledge/services/lead-browse.md)).
3. **Call Lead Ingestion + Enrichment** — `POST /api/v1/call-leads`. Owner Manual tab uses this same create route ([Ingestion Origin](../../../CONTEXT.md) Vantage Admin). Follow Up preview is `POST /api/v1/call-leads/enrichment/preview`. The `/enrichment/sync` URL is Owner receipt apply, not `syncCallLeadEnrichment`: [`call-lead.md`](../../docs/knowledge/services/call-lead.md), [`enrichment.md`](../../docs/knowledge/services/enrichment.md).
4. **Granot webhook observations** — `POST /api/webhooks/granot/{lead-created,priority-updated,booking-status-changed}` persist a receipt and return `202`. Capture is not a Lead/Booking write path: [`capture.md`](../../docs/knowledge/granot-lifecycle/capture.md), [`processor.md`](../../docs/knowledge/granot-lifecycle/processor.md), [`drainer.md`](../../docs/knowledge/granot-lifecycle/drainer.md).
5. **Granot HTTP automation** — `/api/v1/admin/granot-automation/*`. Apply captures a receipt and enters the shared processor: [`granot-http-collector.md`](../../docs/knowledge/services/granot-http-collector.md).
6. **Booking** — `POST /api/v1/booked-leads`, `/from-source`, `/referral-bookings`, `/leadless-bookings`, `/employee-booking-submissions`. Owner Booking cases are not official Bookings until a gated command. Owner Connect Booking to Lead from `/bookings` or `/manual` is `GET/POST /api/v1/admin/bookings/:bookingId/connect-lead*` (not `/bookings/reconciliation`): [`bookings.md`](../../docs/knowledge/services/bookings.md), [`employee-bookings.md`](../../docs/knowledge/services/employee-bookings.md), [`booking-reconciliation.md`](../../docs/knowledge/granot-lifecycle/booking-reconciliation.md).
7. **Cancellation** — `POST /api/v1/cancelled-leads`. Public v1 rejects Referral Bookings; [`cancelled-lead.md`](../../docs/knowledge/services/cancelled-lead.md).

## Change guidance

- Preserve the owner promise: a lead stays traceable from website or call source through Granot, Mongo, Sheets, booking, and cancellation.
- Before changing workflow logic, read `docs/showcase/owner-workflow.md`, the matching Service, validation payloads, and sheet-sync behavior.
